  "body": "With flights booked and a move already in motion, our motivated vendors are ready to sell, creating an outstanding opportunity to secure a beautifully refreshed home just moments from Orewa Beach and the vibrant town centre.\r\n\r\nPrivately tucked away down a driveway on a Freehold site, this light-filled home has been tastefully renovated and is ready for you to simply move in and enjoy. Designed with effortless living in mind, the open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flows seamlessly to a sun-drenched, private deck, perfect for entertaining, weekend BBQs, or unwinding with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThe home offers three generous bedrooms, complemented by a well-appointed bathroom and separate WC, delivering both comfort and practicality for everyday living.\r\n\r\nAdding further appeal is the single internal access garage with a spacious laundry area, enhancing the home’s functionality. With schools, shops, cafés, and restaurants all within easy walking distance, you’ll love the convenience and relaxed coastal lifestyle on offer.\r\n\r\nHomes in this location are always in demand and opportunities like this don’t last long. Delay could mean disappointment.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are committed to a sale. This charming coastal home MUST BE SOLD.\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange your private viewing or visit the open home...but act quickly!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
